+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` (exported from `src/index.ts`) implements RFC 7386: an object patch is
+merged into the target member by member, `null` removes a member, and any other patch value (including
+arrays) replaces the target. It returns a new value without mutating `target` or `patch`.
